{"module":"/assets/explain/knowledge/amgm-formula.js","part":"figure","scope":"amgm-formula","title":"半圆图解：为什么几何平均不超过算术平均","note":"直径分成长 $a$、$b$ 的两段，分点处的半弦长 $\\sqrt{ab}$，半径长 $\\frac{a+b}2$；演示中固定 $a+b=8$。","after":"formula","cases":["positive","fixed","apply","equal"],"stylesheet":"/assets/explain/knowledge/amgm-formula.css","version":"7f41d849e28f","html":"<div class=\"ag-explorer\">\n      <p class=\"ag-ask\">直径长 a + b = 8，拖动分点，比较半弦和半径：</p>\n      <svg class=\"ag-graph\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 196\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"ag-graph-title\">\n    <title id=\"ag-graph-title\">半圆：直径分成长 a 和 b 的两段，分点处向上的半弦长 √(ab)，半径长 (a+b)/2</title>\n    <path d=\"M30 168A140 140 0 0 1 310 168\" class=\"ag-arc\"/>\n    <path d=\"M24 168H316\" class=\"ag-diameter\"/>\n    <g data-ag-layer></g>\n  </svg>\n      <input class=\"ag-slider\" type=\"range\" data-ag-slider min=\"0.5\" max=\"7.5\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"2\" aria-label=\"a 的长度\">\n      <p class=\"ag-readout\" aria-live=\"polite\" data-ag-readout></p>\n      <p class=\"ag-legend\">半弦总不超过半径，分点在圆心（a = b）时两者相等。</p>\n    </div>"}
